{"id": "076_angelique_04|angel-04-breakdown3|L5", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She catches her breath. As for you, you approach her destination…", "passage": "angel-04-breakdown3", "es": "Recupera el aliento. En cuanto a ti, te acercas a su destino…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "hint": "Ella recupera el aliento. En cuanto a ti, te estás acercando a su destino…", "hint_origin": "aligned+verified"}
